# Tracer: prior definition Results extend the compiler environment stack.
#
# Each successful object definition publishes its exact Litex object,
# SymbolId and Lean declaration name to the current compiler environment.
# The later fact Result retains the runtime-resolved comparison evidence;
# StmtResultToLeanCompiler recomputes 0 <= 1 + 2 from those visible bindings.
have a R = 1
have b R = 2
a + b >= 0

# The comparison Result also owns the typed infer child deriving
# -1 * (a + b) <= 0 from the stored source FactId. Corrupting a defining
# FactId, a visible binding, either retained normal form, or the infer premise
# is rejected before Lean source is emitted.
